    # If check status fails, do not download (file not created). Print headers (if print includes h)
    # In observed download 404 case, headers were printed (print default hb -> h). If print_str is default hb (we set), need components h only? Download print never prints body via printer.
    # Determine headers components: if 'h' in print_str
